    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nON OPEN VIEW SATURDAY 03RD OCTOBER 11.30AM - 12PM. \n\nSherry FitzGerald has the pleasure of presenting 100 Glasnevin Downs to the market. Glasnevin Downs is an enclave of attractive homes set in a quiet leafy corner of Glasnevin. No 100. is sure to appeal to many buyers with its fantastic location overlooking a green area.\n\nIt briefly comprises; entrance hallway, guest wc, living room, kitchen/ dining room with large understairs storage. Upstairs a most spacious landing gives way to three fine bedrooms and a family bathroom. The property further benefits from a private sunny west facing rear garden and off street parking to the front.\nThe front garden provides off street parking to the front and a side passage gives access to the rear garden. The rear garden in completely private, it is laid in lawn, contains a garden shed and features a small patio area.\n \nGlasnevin Downs has always been a popular location for families and houses there are rare to come to the market for sale. Located close to the city centre, shopping centres and numerous local amenities, a great selection of national and secondary schools are within walking distance. Drumcondra Village is also close by with its many shops, cafes and restaurants and a well serviced public transport system. This spacious property ticks all the boxes for convenient family living and is just a short stroll from the renowned Botanic Gardens.\n\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nwith guest wc and alarm point.\n\nLiving Room - 4.20m x 3.77m\nspacious room with carpet flooring and open fireplace.\n\nKitchen - 2.37m x 2.17m\nThe kitchen area is extended and features ample storage and is plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nDining Room - 4.70m x 3.30m\nthe dining are is spacious and provides access to a larger under stairs storage unit.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.00m x 2.90m\nlocated to the rear of the property with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.40m x 2.79m\nlocated to the front of the property with carpet flooring and built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.40m x 2.00m\nlarge single room with carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.20m x 1.77m\npartly tiled with wc, whb and bath with shower.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Charming three bedroom end of terrace property</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Off street parking</li><li>Overlooking large green to the front</li><li>West facing rear garden</li><li>Excellent location close to abundance of amenities</li><li>Short drive to M1, M50 and Dublin Airport</ul>"
      },
